WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:09.508
Try it first in Practice if you like: write the way a customer would.

2
00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:18.630
Your assistant drafts a reply. Read it, change what you like, and send it.

3
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:24.032
The step is done when you send a reply to a real customer, in Customers.
